# ZooKeeper Zab Java port by Claude Opus (benchmarks-cf/zookeeper-zab-opus), the pair of the Opus Rust port (owner 2026-11-09). brain12 (shared: half machine, wait on foreign load), no time limit.
# Exports at (e,late) = (1,0), (1,1), (2,0), (2,1), the larger ones after (1,0); joins against S_raft (imports/sraft-e<e>), S_zab (imports/C3E.zookeeper-derived.spec_<e>_<late>) and the Rust port (imports/C3E.zookeeper-zab-rust.impl_<e>_<late>), all copied to this node's imports.
